# Z's block-by-block and wire-by-wire validation of the model (concern C-30,
# ruling R-48, sheet 07-09). One row per validated part kind or wire, named
# as in model/og-caie.model.ttl; scripts/render.py renders sheet 05 from the
# model graph and reads the ticks here, so regeneration never loses them.
# A validated name that no longer exists in the model is reported by the
# tests as stale.

